/li></ul><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><strong class="font-semibold"><span>Important:</span></strong><span> The code below creates the animation and effects. To show Naruto and Hinata exactly like the picture, you'll also need an image of the couple.</span></p><h2 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>Step 1: Create </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span></h2><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Open Notepad on your laptop, copy all the code below, and save the file as </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span><span>.</span></p><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-code-block="true" data-markdown-copy="code-block" data-theme="dark" class="relative Root-iW7ipz w-full min-w-0 contain-inline-size overflow-clip rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle text-default CodeSurface-UAMd1A Surface-BCuIs1 dark @container" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" contenteditable="false" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none ActionBar-KWWAct min-h-12 gap-2 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 StickyActionBar-RZfVQh"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-a37f3c54c7d1d31c.svg#code-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate">HTML</div><div class="ms-auto flex items-center min-w-0 max-w-full"><div data-code-block-controls="true" role="presentation" class="flex items-center gap-px print:hidden flex-wrap justify-end"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 fo