ver data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent h-9 gap-1.5 border-0 px-2 py-0 text-sm leading-5 aspect-square shrink-0 items-center justify-center !px-0" aria-label="Preview"><span class="CompactSource-d7ZD01"><svg aria-hidden="true" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-a37f3c54c7d1d31c.svg#play-light-16" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span><span class="LeadingSource-d79mNZ"><svg aria-hidden="true" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-a37f3c54c7d1d31c.svg#play-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></span></div></div></div><div class="relative [container-type:inline-size]"><div class="InlineCodePane-EYx4bd w-full overflow-x-hidden"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full Viewer-ALA646" dir="ltr"><div class="chatgpt-code-scrollport flex w-full items-stretch overscroll-x-contain Scrollport-kY3Nlm overflow-x-auto"><pre class="m-0 flex-1 cursor-text px-4 pb-3 font-mono text-size-code text-default md:px-5 ViewerContent-Cg8AgN pt-0 min-w-max whitespace-pre"><code><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;html</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">lang</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"en"</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;head&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;meta</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">charset</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"UTF-8"</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;meta</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">name</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"viewport"</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">content</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;title&gt;</span><span>Naruto ❤️ Hinata</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/title&gt;</span><span>

    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;style&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">*</span><span> {
            margin: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>;
            padding: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>;
            box-sizing: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">border-box</span><span>;
        }

        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">body</span><span> {
            height: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">100</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">vh</span><span>;
            overflow: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">hidden</span><span>;
            display: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">flex</span><span>;
            justify-content: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">center</span><span>;
            align-items: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">center</span><span>;
            font-family: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">Arial</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">sans-serif</span><span>;
            background: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">linear-gradient</span><span>(
                </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">135</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">deg</span><span>,
                #ffb6c1,
                #ffcce7,
                #c8b6ff
            );
        }

        .</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">scene</span><span> {
            position: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">relative</span><span>;
            width: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">100</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">%</span><span>;
            height: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">100</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">%</span><span>;
            display: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">flex</span><span>;
            justify-content: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">center</span><span>;
            align-items: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">center</span><span>;
            overflow: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">hidden</span><span>;
        }

        .</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">glow</span><span> {
            position: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">absolute</span><span>;
            width: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">350</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
            height: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">350</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
            background: #fff0f5;
            border-radius: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">50</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">%</span><span>;
            filter: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">blur</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">70</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>);
            animation: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">glow</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">4</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">s</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">infinite</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">alternate</span><span>;
        }

        .</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">couple</span><span> {
            position: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">relative</span><span>;
            z-index: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">2</span><span>;
            text-align: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">center</span><span>;
            animation: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">appear</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">2</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">s</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">ease</span><span>;
        }

        .</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">couple</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">img</span><span> {
            width: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">min</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">85</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">vw</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">650</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>);
            max-height: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">65</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">vh</span><span>;
            object-fit: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">contain</span><span>;
            border-radius: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">25</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
            box-shadow: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">10</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">35</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> #8e447a55;
        }

        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">h1</span><span> {
            margin-top: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">20</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
            color: #9b245b;
            font-size: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">clamp</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">25</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">5</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">vw</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">45</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>);
            text-shadow: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">2</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">2</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">10</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">white</span><span>;
        }

        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">p</span><span> {
            margin-top: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">10</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
            color: #79315c;
            font-size: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">18</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
        }

        .</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">petal</span><span>, .</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">heart</span><span> {
            position: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">absolute</span><span>;
            top: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">-40</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
            pointer-events: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">none</span><span>;
            animation: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">fall</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">linear</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">forwards</span><span>;
        }

        .</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">petal</span><span> {
            color: #ff5c9a;
            font-size: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">25</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
        }

        .</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">heart</span><span> {
            color: #ff1744;
            font-size: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">22</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
            animation-name: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">floatHeart</span><span>;
        }

        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">button</span><span> {
            margin-top: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">18</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
            padding: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">12</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">25</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
            border: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">none</span><span>;
            border-radius: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">25</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
            background: #ff4f91;
            color: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">white</span><span>;
            font-size: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">16</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">px</span><span>;
            cursor: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">pointer</span><span>;
        }

        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">button</span><span>:</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">hover</span><span> {
            background: #e91e63;
            transform: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">scale</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1.05</span><span>);
        }

        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">@keyframes</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">fall</span><span> {
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">from</span><span> {
                transform: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">translateY</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">-5</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">vh</span><span>) </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">rotate</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">deg</span><span>);
            }
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">to</span><span> {
                transform: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">translateY</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">110</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">vh</span><span>) </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">rotate</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">720</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">deg</span><span>);
            }
        }

        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">@keyframes</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">floatHeart</span><span> {
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">from</span><span> {
                transform: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">translateY</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">100</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">vh</span><span>) </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">scale</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0.5</span><span>);
                opacity: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>;
            }
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">20</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">%</span><span> {
                opacity: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1</span><span>;
            }
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">to</span><span> {
                transform: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">translateY</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">-15</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">vh</span><span>) </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">scale</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1.5</span><span>);
                opacity: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>;
            }
        }

        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">@keyframes</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">appear</span><span> {
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">from</span><span> {
                opacity: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>;
                transform: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">scale</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0.8</span><span>);
            }
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">to</span><span> {
                opacity: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1</span><span>;
                transform: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">scale</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1</span><span>);
            }
        }

        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">@keyframes</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">glow</span><span> {
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">from</span><span> {
                transform: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">scale</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0.8</span><span>);
                opacity: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0.5</span><span>;
            }
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">to</span><span> {
                transform: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">scale</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1.2</span><span>);
                opacity: </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1</span><span>;
            }
        }
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/style&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/head&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;body&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">class</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"scene"</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">class</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"glow"</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">class</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"couple"</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&gt;</span><span>
            </span><span class="Comment-dh5VVn">&lt;!-- Add your Naruto and Hinata picture here --&gt;</span><span>
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;img</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">src</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"couple.jpg"</span><span>
                 </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">alt</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"Naruto and Hinata together"</span><span>
                 </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">onerror</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"this.style.display='none'"</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&gt;</span><span>

            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;h1&gt;</span><span>Naruto ❤️ Hinata</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><span>
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>Two hearts, one beautiful story 🌸</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;button</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">onclick</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">showLove</span><span>()</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&gt;</span><span>
                Send Love 💗
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/button&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;script&gt;</span><span>
        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">function</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">createPetal</span><span>() {
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">const</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">petal</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">document</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>createElement(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"div"</span><span>);

            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">petal</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>className </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"petal"</span><span>;
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">petal</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>textContent </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">Math</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>random() </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">&gt;</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0.5</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">?</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"🌸"</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">:</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"🌷"</span><span>;

            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">petal</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>style</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>left </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">Math</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>random() </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">*</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">100</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">+</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"vw"</span><span>;
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">petal</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>style</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>animationDuration </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span>
                (</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">4</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">+</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">Math</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>random() </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">*</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">5</span><span>) </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">+</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"s"</span><span>;

            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">document</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>querySelector(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">".scene"</span><span>)</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>appendChild(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">petal</span><span>);

            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">setTimeout</span><span>(() =&gt; </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">petal</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>remove(), </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">9000</span><span>);
        }

        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">function</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">createHeart</span><span>() {
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">const</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">heart</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">document</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>createElement(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"div"</span><span>);

            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">heart</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>className </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"heart"</span><span>;
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">heart</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>textContent </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"❤️"</span><span>;
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">heart</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>style</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>left </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">Math</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>random() </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">*</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">100</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">+</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"vw"</span><span>;
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">heart</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>style</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>animationDuration </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span>
                (</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">4</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">+</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">Math</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>random() </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">*</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">3</span><span>) </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">+</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"s"</span><span>;

            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">document</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>querySelector(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">".scene"</span><span>)</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>appendChild(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">heart</span><span>);

            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">setTimeout</span><span>(() =&gt; </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">heart</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">.</span><span>remove(), </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">8000</span><span>);
        }

        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">function</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">showLove</span><span>() {
            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">for</span><span> (</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">let</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">i</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">=</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">0</span><span>; </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">i</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">&lt;</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">20</span><span>; </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">i</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">++</span><span>) {
                </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">setTimeout</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">createHeart</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">i</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-keyword">*</span><span> </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">100</span><span>);
            }

            </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">alert</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-string">"Naruto ❤️ Hinata — Forever Together!"</span><span>);
        }

        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">setInterval</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">createPetal</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">300</span><span>);
        </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">setInterval</span><span>(</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-variable">createHeart</span><span>, </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-literal">1200</span><span>);
    </span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/script&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/body&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="text-codex-syntax-name">&lt;/html&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div></div><button class="group/scroll-to-bottom cursor-interaction absolute z-30 flex h-8 w-8 translate-x-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-default bg-surface bg-clip-padding text-secondary transition-opacity duration-basic ease-in-out end-1/2 print:hidden pointer-events-none opacity-0 bottom-4" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Scroll to bottom" tabindex="-1" type="button"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC text-default" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-a37f3c54c7d1d31c.svg#arrow-down-lg-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><h2 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>Step 2: Add the couple's picture</span></h2><ol class="List-kOVW5V OrderedList-XsMUSX" dir="auto" start="1"><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Save the Naruto and Hinata couple picture on your laptop.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Rename the picture to </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">couple.jpg</span><span>.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Put it in the </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>same folder</span></strong><span> as </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span><span>.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span>Double-click </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span><span> to open it in Chrome.</span></li></ol><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Your folder should look like this:</span></p><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-code-block="true" data-markdown-copy="code-block" data-theme="dark" class="relative Root-iW7ipz w-full min-w-0 contain-inline-size overflow-clip ro