mp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Maggieee ❤️🥰 Yes! Mottu will give you the </span><strong class="font-semibold"><span>complete Naruto ❤️ Hinata animation project using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript</span></strong><span>.</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>We'll create a romantic animation with falling cherry blossoms, floating hearts, glowing effects, and Naruto and Hinata together. 🌸💕</span></p><h2 class="Heading-Ro3lZr" dir="auto"><span>💻 Step 1: Create three files</span></h2><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>On your laptop, create a folder called </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">NarutoHinata</span><span>.</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Inside it, create these three files:</span></p><ol class="List-kOVW5V OrderedList-XsMUSX" dir="auto" start="1"><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">index.html</span><span> — webpage structure.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">style.css</span><span> — colors, design, and animations.</span></li><li class="ListItem-ncLgmg"><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">script.js</span><span> — falling petals and floating hearts.</span></li></ol><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Also, save your Naruto and Hinata couple picture in the same folder as </span><span data-markdown-copy="inline-code" class="InlineCode-Cddi3Y InlineMarkdownIsolate-QWDV4W" dir="ltr">couple.jpg</span><span>.</span></p><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Your folder should look like this:</span></p><div class="CodeBlock-zu1QM3"><div data-code-block="true" data-markdown-copy="code-block" data-theme="dark" class="relative Root-iW7ipz w-full min-w-0 contain-inline-size overflow-clip rounded-(--radius-3xl-base) border border-subtle text-default CodeSurface-UAMd1A Surface-BCuIs1 dark @container" data-search-result-target=""><div data-markdown-copy="exclude" contenteditable="false" class="flex items-center font-sans text-sm select-none ActionBar-KWWAct min-h-12 gap-2 py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-medium text-default md:ps-5 sticky z-10 StickyActionBar-RZfVQh"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-a37f3c54c7d1d31c.svg#code-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate">Plain text</div><div class="ms-auto flex items-center min-w-0 max-w-full"><div data-code-block-controls="true" role="presentation" class="flex items-center gap-px print:hidden flex-wrap justify-end"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full text-default not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent h-9 gap-1.5 border-0 px-2 py-0 text-sm leading-5 aspect-square shrink-0 items-center justify-center !px-0" aria-label="Enable word wrap" aria-pressed="false"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-a37f3c54c7d1d31c.svg#text-overflow-light-20" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" cl